file string   Agent context profile override: full or lite\\n      --insecure                 Skip TLS certificate verification (for self-signed certs)\\n      --json                     Output in JSON format\\n      --no-update-check          Disable automatic update check\\n      --remote string            Remote board server URL (overrides TASK_BOARD_REMOTE)\\n      --remote-board string      Remote board ID (overrides TASK_BOARD_ID)\\n\\nUse \\\"task-board resource [command] --help\\\" for more information about a command.\\n===TASK SHOW===\\nmutation error: parse error at 1:1: unknown operation \\\"get\\\" (got \\\"get\\\"); known operations: add_checklist_item, add_resource, assign, audit_context_validation, check_item, collect_context_retention, confirm_context_reclamation, correct_activity, create, delete, delete_resource, handoff, link, login, logout, mark_context_stale, normalize_legacy_status, publish_context, reclassify_context, record_ledger_event, register_context, remove_checklist_item, rename, retire_context, retry_context_payload_withdrawal, set_details, set_estimate, set_notes, set_parent, set_status, sweep_context_retention, sweep_context_validation_audits, switch_user, unassign, uncheck_item, unlink, update_resource; see schema() for the contract and schema(mutation=NAME) for one signature\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2295,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 574,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
